bscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/vnd.appimage","state":"uploaded","size":127634898,"digest":"sha256:3b5f72a01847e864b573ed984527623f09e67ec1acd7593193c880ddfec0fe72","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-29T18:37:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T18:37:52Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/download/v0.4.0/GameBridge-0.4.0.AppImage"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/tarball/v0.4.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/zipball/v0.4.0","body":"GameBridge now runs on Linux. This release has the Linux packages; the Windows installer for 0.4.0 will follow, and [0.3.1](https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/tag/v0.3.1) stays the Windows download until then.\n\n## Install (Arch Linux)\n1. Download **GameBridge-0.4.0-x86_64.pkg.tar.xz** below.\n2. Install it with pacman:\n   ```bash\n   sudo pacman -U GameBridge-0.4.0-x86_64.pkg.tar.xz\n   ```\n\nIt installs to `/opt/GameBridge`, with a `gamebridge` command and an app menu entry.\n\n## Install (other Linux)\nDownload **GameBridge-0.4.0.AppImage**, make it executable (`chmod +x GameBridge-0.4.0.AppImage`) and run it. AppImages need FUSE 2 (`libfuse2` on Debian and Ubuntu).\n\n## New\n- **Linux support.** Unity editors are found through Unity Hub and in `~/Unity/Hub/Editor`. Unreal engines are found from `~/.config/Epic/UnrealEngine/Install.ini` or unpacked in your home folder, `~/Unreal`, `~/Epic Games` or `/opt`. VS Code and JetBrains IDEs come from your PATH, Toolbox or `/opt`.\n- **Stopping** a game, build, upload or transfer now ends everything it started, not just the first process.\n\n## Not tested yet on Linux\n- Running against a real Unity or Unreal install. If the Unity editor list stays empty, please open an issue.\n- Closing an open editor before a build sends it SIGTERM, so Unity may not offer to save first.\n\n## Licence\nFree to use for anything, including commercial games, under the [PolyForm Shield License 1.0.0](https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/blob/Master/LICENSE.md). The one exception is building a product that competes with GameBridge.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/422950393","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/422950393/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/422950393/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/tag/v0.3.1","id":422950393,"author":{"login":"cookiester34","id":47158495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU4NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47158495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34","html_url":"https://github.com/cookiester34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDONWP-xc4ZNbX5","tag_name":"v0.3.1","target_commitish":"Master","name":"GameBridge 0.3.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-24T18:55:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:58:04Z","published_at":"2026-10-24T19:58:04Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/assets/673172244","id":673172244,"node_id":"RA_kwDONWP-xc4oH8sU","name":"GameBridge-Setup-0.3.1.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"cookiester34","id":47158495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU4NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47158495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34","html_url":"https://github.com/cookiester34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":122696143,"digest":"sha256:1e6e9dc39af3cb32ab2c755a573288f3d7d6b1c9766e7e96c03bed3ccd561d2c","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-24T19:57:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:58:04Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/download/v0.3.1/GameBridge-Setup-0.3.1.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/tarball/v0.3.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/zipball/v0.3.1","body":"Fixes for transferring real Fab packs. Everyone using Transfer should install this.\n\n## Install (Windows)\n1. Download **GameBridge-Setup-0.3.1.exe** below and run it. Installing over an earlier version keeps your projects and settings.\n2. The installer isn't code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may warn you. Click **More info → Run anyway**.\n\n## Fixed\n- **Transfers into a Unity project on another drive** failed for every mesh and texture Unreal exported. Unreal writes to the temp folder on C:, and moving files from there to another drive now works.\n- **Material functions** (`MF_…`) were treated as materials and failed. They're pieces of other materials, so they now stay behind with a reason, while the materials that use them are rebuilt.\n- **HDR and high bit-depth textures** couldn't be saved as PNG. They now come across as HDR, EXR or TGA.\n\n## Improved\n- **Packs made for an older Unreal version** no longer need that exact version installed. GameBridge uses the nearest newer one from the same major version (for example 5.4 for a 5.2 pack); it only reads the assets and changes nothing on disk.\n- **A downloaded project unzipped inside another project's Content** breaks every reference inside it. GameBridge now spots this and offers to transfer from the nested project directly, and it warns when a project has broken material or texture references.\n- Electron updated to 44.9 for a security fix.\n\n## Licence\nFree to use for anything, including commercial games, under the [PolyForm Shield License 1.0.0](https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/blob/Master/LICENSE.md). The one exception is building a product that competes with GameBridge.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/420720521","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/420720521/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/420720521/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/tag/v0.3.0","id":420720521,"author":{"login":"cookiester34","id":47158495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU4NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47158495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34","html_url":"https://github.com/cookiester34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDONWP-xc4ZE6-J","tag_name":"v0.3.0","target_commitish":"Master","name":"GameBridge 0.3.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-22T12:53:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:53:50Z","published_at":"2026-10-22T12:53:50Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/assets/665878031","id":665878031,"node_id":"RA_kwDONWP-xc4nsH4P","name":"GameBridge-Setup-0.3.0.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"cookiester34","id":47158495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU4NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47158495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34","html_url":"https://github.com/cookiester34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":122250539,"digest":"sha256:4a12b1c4943fb8cce55d2c66e29eb30c2b1d87cecda2bf98c747386dcc126319","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-22T12:53:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:53:49Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/download/v0.3.0/GameBridge-Setup-0.3.0.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/tarball/v0.3.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/zipball/v0.3.0","body":"Bring Unreal and Fab assets into Unity.\n\n## Install (Windows)\n1. Download **GameBridge-Setup-0.3.0.exe** below and run it. Installing over an earlier version keeps your projects and settings.\n2. The installer isn't code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may warn you. Click **More info → Run anyway**.\n\n## New: Transfer\nA new **Transfer** section in the sidebar moves assets from an Unreal project into a Unity project.\n\n- **Sounds** come across as WAV in seconds, with no Unreal needed. Unreal keeps the original WAV inside every sound asset, and GameBridge copies it straight out.\n- **Meshes, characters and animations** are exported as FBX by Unreal, which runs in the background with no editor window. Characters and animations import into Unity as Humanoid.\n- **Materials** are rebuilt as Unity materials for the project's render pipeline (URP, HDRP or built-in) and hooked up to the models. Tick a model and its materials and textures come along with it.\n- **Fab downloads**: drop a .zip or .unitypackage on the window to unpack it into the Unity project. Unity packages keep their GUIDs, so prefabs still find their textures.\n\nSound cues, Blueprints and other Unreal-only assets stay behind, and the screen tells you which. Meshes, characters, animations and materials need the Unreal version the project was made with to be installed.\n\n## Also\n- Unreal engines installed in custom folders are now found through the Epic launcher, which also fixes launching Unreal projects from those engines.\n\n## Licence\nFree to use for anything, including commercial games, under the [PolyForm Shield License 1.0.0](https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/blob/Master/LICENSE.md). The one exception is building a product that competes with GameBridge.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/412593325","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/412593325/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/412593325/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/tag/v0.2.1","id":412593325,"author":{"login":"cookiester34","id":47158495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU4NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47158495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34","html_url":"https://github.com/cookiester34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDONWP-xc4Yl6yt","tag_name":"v0.2.1","target_commitish":"Master","name":"GameBridge 0.2.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-14T10:31:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T10:33:04Z","published_at":"2026-10-14T10:33:04Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/assets/640039329","id":640039329,"node_id":"RA_kwDONWP-xc4mJjmh","name":"GameBridge-Setup-0.2.1.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"cookiester34","id":47158495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU4NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47158495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34","html_url":"https://github.com/cookiester34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":122228233,"digest":"sha256:44b92e2c23bb93f4755f87f7015e06033198921b8f127aa1f069e06e28c3fbff","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-14T10:31:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T10:32:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/download/v0.2.1/GameBridge-Setup-0.2.1.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/tarball/v0.2.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/zipball/v0.2.1","body":"Security update. Everyone on 0.2.0 should install this.\n\n## Install (Windows)\n1. Download **GameBridge-Setup-0.2.1.exe** below and run it. It installs for your user only, so there's no admin prompt, and you can pick the folder.\n2. The installer isn't code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may warn you. Click **More info → Run anyway**.\n3. Installing over 0.2.0 keeps your projects and settings.\n\n## What's changed\n- **Electron 34 → 44.** 0.2.0 shipped on an Electron version that no longer gets security fixes.\n- **Safer asset store tabs.** Store pages run in a sandbox, and links they open can only go to web pages. Before, a page could ask Windows to open a local file or a custom protocol link.\n- **New installer.** Shows the licence, lets you choose the install folder, and adds Start menu and desktop shortcuts.\n- Build tooling updated (electron-builder 26, Vite 7, Tailwind 4). `npm audit` is clean.\n\n## Licence\nFree to use for anything, including commercial games, under the [PolyForm Shield License 1.0.0](https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/blob/Master/LICENSE.md). The one exception is building a product that competes with GameBridge.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/412581354","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/412581354/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/412581354/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/tag/v0.2.0","id":412581354,"author":{"login":"cookiester34","id":47158495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU4NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47158495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34","html_url":"https://github.com/co