//api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":84485837,"digest":"sha256:3be9694d189cc52675f88356fa6df1597bcc16b565a75131b1340f97f4ef87b6","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-14T10:16:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T10:16:44Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/releases/download/v0.2.0/GameBridge-Setup-0.2.0.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/tarball/v0.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/zipball/v0.2.0","body":"First public release of GameBridge, a launcher for Unity, Unreal and custom engine projects.\n\nThis version is a full rewrite as a desktop app. The earlier C# version is kept on the `legacy-csharp` branch.\n\n## Install (Windows)\n1. Download **GameBridge-Setup-0.2.0.exe** below and run it.\n2. The installer isn't code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may warn you. Click **More info → Run anyway**.\n3. In Settings, run **Auto-detect engines** and **Auto-detect IDEs**, add the folders your projects live in, then press **Scan** on the Library page.\n\n## Highlights\n- One table for all your projects: sortable and resizable columns, tag and engine filters, favourites\n- Open a project on its own or together with your IDE\n- Headless Unity builds with live progress, numbered build folders and version bumping\n- Build reports, asset analysis and a cleanup tab with a reversible quarantine\n- Upload builds to Steam, itch.io or a custom command, only when you ask\n- Log viewer for running games and editors, a form-based JSON data editor, and asset store tabs\n\n## Licence\nFree to use for anything, including commercial games, under the [PolyForm Shield License 1.0.0](https://github.com/CookieJarTools/GameBridge/blob/Master/LICENSE.md). The one exception is building a product that competes with GameBridge.\n"}]